         BALOCHISTAN</h1>
        <h1>THE UNSEEN BEAUTY</h1>

        
        <p>Where Mountains Meet The Sea.</p>
        
        <h2 style="color:rgb(125, 131, 124);">Why Balochistan</h2>
        
        <p class="paragraph">
                   Pakistan's largest province, but least explored. It has everything <br>in one place-golden desert, blue beaches, snowy forests, volcanoes, and 7000 <br>years of history. Row, peaceful, and untouched. No crowd, no noise-just nature.</p>
        
       <h1  style="text-align: center; ">Places you must visit</h1>

       <hr>

       <h3 class="heading ">
    1.  Kun Malir Beach-Gwadar Coastal Highway 
        </h3>
        
        
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 70px;">
        
             <p class="paragraph">Golden desert mountains touching blue sea. This is not <br> Maldives, this is better and it's ours. Camp at night, stars look like diamonds. <br> Best time: <b>October to March.</b></p>
             <img src="c:\Users\PC\Downloads\hhhh.jpg" width="220" height="220" alt=" Take it from Google">
        
        </div>


        <h3 class="heading ">
             2.    Hingol National Park-Pakistan's Largest
        </h3>


        <div style="display: flex;">
             <p class="paragraph">Feels like Mars on Earth. You will see Princess <br>of Hope (naturak rock statue), Active mud volcanoes,  and wild <br>ibex. Also home to Hinglaj Mata Temple. Jeep safari is a must.</p> 
            <div style="padding: 30px;">
             <img src="c:\Users\PC\Downloads\Moola_Chotuk,_Khuzdar,_Balochistan.jpg" alt="find from google">
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="heading ">
             3.    Ziarat-City of Juniper (Near Quetta)
        </h3>

       <div style="display: flex; gap:30px ;">
             <p>5000-year-old juniper forests-some are the oldest trees in the world. Quid-e-Azam <br>Residency, snowfall in winter, and pure peace.Best for family trip from Quetta.</p>
            <div style="text-align: center; gap: 10px;">
                <img src="c:\Users\PC\Downloads\images.jpg" width="250" height="160" alt=" find it">
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="heading">
            4.Gawadar & Astola Island-Jewel of Arabian Sea
        </h3>
        
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
             <p class="paragraph">CrystalClear water where you can see fish. Boat ride from Gawadar, <br>dolphins follow your boat. Pakistan's first marine protected  island. Activities: snorkeling, <br>fishing, boat camping.</p>
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <img src="c:\Users\PC\Downloads\hh1.jpg" width="200" height="190" alt="find it">
            </div>
        </div>
       <h3 class="heading">
             5. Moola Chotok-Hidden Waterfall of Khuzdar
        </h3>
       
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
             <p class="paragraph">A waterfall in the middle of desert mountains. 8-hour of road adventure to <br> reach it. Very difficult road but when you reach-you won't believe your eyes.</p>
            
            <div style="text-align: center;">   
                <img src="c:\Users\PC\Downloads\hwhw.jpg" width="200" height="190" alt="find it">
            </div> 
        </div>
